# Line endings: the repo keeps LF and checks text files out as LF everywhere, so commits on Windows
# (core.autocrlf=true) stop warning "LF will be replaced by CRLF". Windows scripts stay CRLF in the working
# copy: cmd.exe misreads labels and goto in LF batch files, and the server runs these as they are copied.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.psm1 text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.exe binary
*.db binary
